    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Parts of a legend",
     "texto": [
      "A story can introduce its characters, tell the main events and close with a consequence or a moral message. **Asal-usul** means \"origin\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Message and promise",
     "texto": [
      "**Pesan moral** and **amanat** refer to the lesson of a story. **Menepati janji** is to keep a promise; **melanggar janji**, to break it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
